Revision history for App::Ariza::Example::Vault

{{$NEXT}}
    - First version. An encrypted key/value vault: SQLCipher through
      DBIish, with set, get, list and delete commands for scripts and a
      show command that draws a table with notcurses direct mode. The
      database path and passphrase come from options or environment
      variables and are never prompted for. ariza.toml bundles it with
      both native libraries and smoke-checks an encrypted round trip
      and a wrong-passphrase rejection in a clean environment.
